# Objective Tracker: {{exam_name}} ({{exam_code}})

The exam guide outline as a checklist. One row per study session; big objectives are split into a/b sessions. Updated at each close-out (see `petey/method.md`).

**Status:** ⬜ not started · 🔵 in progress (paused, see Resume note) · 🟡 taught, but quiz < 6/7 or an unresolved 🔥 · ✅ quiz ≥ 6/7 and no unresolved 🔥
**Quiz (/7)** = score on the 7 questions for that objective (add `(+N/3 interleaved)` for the other 3). **🔥** = confident-wrong count in that session.
**Prior misses** = MissLog entries already touching this objective (from a baseline, if any).
**Hands-on** (optional) = a short task done for this objective. It doesn't affect status.

